&gt;&gt; Greg: THAT'S WHY IT HAS

00:13:01.781 --> 00:13:05.451 line:78%
TO BE A PUNITIVE, SYMBOLIC

00:13:03.282 --> 00:13:06.118 line:78%
KIND OF THING.

00:13:05.551 --> 00:13:07.720 line:78%
&gt;&gt; UNEFFECTED PEOPLE -- LIKE

00:13:06.218 --> 00:13:08.554 line:78%
